## Typography — mobile (xs)

```bash
MOBILE_FONT_SIZE_TEXT=4
MOBILE_FONT_SIZE_TITLE=3
MOBILE_FONT_SIZE_BUTTON=6
MOBILE_FONT_SIZE_MENU=8
```

Numeric **N** → **Nvw** (`singlesMemberCardFontEnv.js`, `buttonFontEnv.js`, `menuNavFontEnv.js`). Sidebar menu labels render at 90% of `*_FONT_SIZE_MENU` (`SIDEBAR_MENU_TEXT_SCALE`). `MOBILE_FONT_SIZE_BUTTON` also sets xs popup input height (ColorTemplate7).

